{"synopsis":"Kasim Lee Cheolsu, sosok kuat yang mengendalikan urusan kekaisaran dari balik layar sesuka hati. dia memiliki kekuasaan, kekayaan dan seni beladiri yang kuat… tapi apa gunanya semua itu kalau tidak bisa melakukan ‘itu’?!\n\nCheolsu berhasil kembali ke masa sebelum dia menjadi kasim dengan menggunakan Teknik Reincarnation.\nDia hanya memikirkan satu hal, yaitu menjadi seorang pria alpha yang menikmati hidup bersama wanita tercantik!","alternative_title":"2회차 환관이 남성을 되찾음, The Eunuch Regains His Manhood in His Second Life, The Eunuch's Rebirth: A Journey Back to Manhood","author":"Lico","artist":"Force Studio","chapters":[{"number":"100","chapter":"100","slug":"35aafabe-dff1-4d44-8cb1-3efe1fd5a8df","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"number":"99","chapter":"99","slug":"76e6ac3a-5241-4bdc-b31c-1af4f823e6cc","date":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"number":"98","chapter":"98","slug":"8370cc44-44fd-4f36-ad87-e11771ce6b62","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"number":"97","chapter":"97","slug":"64cb3d47-82f0-4300-a228-510f01b1e956","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"number":"96","chapter":"96","slug":"bbeed96c-9758-462b-a49c-01feab561f50","date":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"number":"95","chapter":"95","slug":"51d88b29-df22-4968-8cf8-899ba006131a","date":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"number":"94","chapter":"94","slug":"1dcf4812-106a-4211-b7b3-3d5c914e2cf4","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"93","chapter":"93","slug":"94c08870-4a2b-4fe0-9dce-4ed50a8544a8","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"92","chapter":"92","slug":"122cade2-43d8-4564-8d32-9abc644c65a2","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"91","chapter":"91","slug":"b34a05cc-f65d-4f59-82ea-791b0dd64061","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"90","chapter":"90","slug":"262ddeb8-0fe6-4487-849c-ef3b8dff85b6","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"number":"89","chapter":"89","slug":"028e4095-5ef4-4c5e-80ae-339cfd103e0a","date":"2026-05-25","images":[]},{"number":"88","chapter":"88","slug":"0fd57769-d54